  "description": "Blaze 25MPH Electric Motorcycle – Powerful, Long-Range Performance for Any Terrain\nThe Blaze Electric Motorcycle for Teens is engineered for riders who crave power, durability, and off-road freedom. Powered by a 48V 10.4Ah removable battery, Blaze delivers a real-world range of up to 55 miles per charge, giving you reliable distance without constant recharging.\nIts removable external battery design ensures easy charging at home or on the go—no need to haul the entire bike. With an IPX5 water-resistant rating, Blaze stands up to rain, splashes, and unpredictable riding conditions, making it the perfect companion for year-round adventures.\nAt the heart of the Blaze is a PEAK 1500W high-performance brushless motor, built to conquer hills, sand, gravel, and urban roads with ease. The rugged 16\" x 4.0\" fat tires, paired with dual suspension and hydraulic disc brakes, offer maximum control, comfort, and stopping power on rough or uneven terrain.\nWith three versatile riding modes, including full manual, and a simplified 1-speed system, the Blaze adapts to your riding style—whether you're cruising city streets or hitting the trails. Ideal for adults seeking a high-powered, all-terrain electric motorcycle, Blaze combines performance and reliability in one unstoppable machine.",
